Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 02:31:33 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 05/12] event_extensions: Add persistence support

Add serialization and restoration support for runtime event extensions.

Persist extension state in log entry JSON files and restore event
extensions during log recovery. Update Entry ownership APIs and
log serialization infrastructure to support extension lifecycle
management.

Change-Id: I0a86623553c6ab4060600e4ac90bcc4016e34846
Signed-off-by: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
